{"type":"Film","id":"FR2023_073","slug":"fr2023-073-je-verrai-toujours-vos-visages","title":{"native":"Je verrai toujours vos visages","english":"All Your Faces"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2023-03-29","year":2023},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Jeanne Herry","slug":"jeanne-herry","name":"Jeanne Herry","birthYear":1978,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2023-073-je-verrai-toujours-vos-visages","title":{"native":"Je verrai toujours vos visages"}},"year":2024,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2018-182-pupille","title":{"native":"Pupille"}},"year":2019,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"}]}],"genre":["Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/66/251/260930/format_page/je-verrai-toujours-vos-visages.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RLNZ-1v6a-U"},"synopsis":{"native":"Depuis 2014, en France, la Justice Restaurative propose à des personnes victimes et auteurs d'infraction de dialoguer dans des dispositifs sécurisés, encadrés par des professionnels et des bénévoles comme Judith, Fanny ou Michel. Nassim, Issa, et Thomas, condamnés pour vols avec violence, Grégoire, Nawelle et Sabine, victimes de homejacking, de braquages et de vol à l'arraché, mais aussi Chloé, victime de viols incestueux, s'engagent tous dans des mesures de Justice Restaurative. Sur leur parcours, il y a de la colère et de l'espoir, des silences et des mots, des alliances et des déchirements, des prises de conscience et de la conﬁance retrouvée... Et au bout du chemin, parfois, la réparation...","english":"Since 2014, in France, Restorative Justice has offered victims and perpetrators of offences the opportunity to dialogue through secure systems, supervised by professionals and volunteers such as Judith, Fanny or Michel. Nassim, Issa, and Thomas, sentenced for theft with violence, Gregoire, Nawelle and Sabine, victims of home jacking, robbery and purse snatching. Also Chloe, victim of incestuous rape, all engage in measures of Restorative Justice. On their journey, there is anger and hope, silence and words, alliances and heartbreaks, awareness and regained confidence. And at the end of the road, sometimes, reparation."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Anne Benoît","slug":"anne-benoit","name":"Anne Benoît","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Catherine Arditi","slug":"catherine-arditi","name":"Catherine Arditi","birthYear":1946,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Denis Podalydès","slug":"denis-podalydes","name":"Denis Podalydès","birthYear":1963,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2018-088-plaire-aimer-et-courir-vite","title":{"native":"Plaire, aimer et courir vite"}},"year":2019,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Supporting Actor","result":"Nominated"}]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Jean-Pierre Darroussin","slug":"jean-pierre-darroussin","name":"Jean-Pierre Darroussin","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Jeanne Herry","slug":"jeanne-herry","name":"Jeanne Herry","birthYear":1978,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2023-073-je-verrai-toujours-vos-visages","title":{"native":"Je verrai toujours vos visages"}},"year":2024,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2018-182-pupille","title":{"native":"Pupille"}},"year":2019,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nom